Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:11.80,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ 'Twas brillig, and the slithy toves ♪\N♪ Did gyre and gimble in the wabe; ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:23.10,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ All mimsy were the borogoves, ♪\N♪ And the mome raths outgrabe. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:34.20,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ "Beware the Jabberwock, my son! ♪\N♪ The jaws that bite, the claws that catch! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:45.40,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ Beware the Jubjub bird, and shun ♪\N♪ The frumious Bandersnatch!" ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:56.50,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ He took his vorpal sword in hand: ♪\N♪ Long time the manxome foe he sought— ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:01:07.90,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ So rested he by the Tumtum tree, ♪\N♪ And stood awhile in thought. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:19.00,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ And as in uffish thought he stood, ♪\N♪ The Jabberwock, with eyes of flame, ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:30.20,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ Came whiffling through the tulgey wood, ♪\N♪ And burbled as it came! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:41.50,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ One, two! One, two! And through and through ♪\N♪ The vorpal blade went snicker-snack! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:58.50,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ He left it dead, and with its head ♪\N♪ He went galumphing back. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:54.90,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ Twinkle, twinkle, twinkle, twinkle... ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.50,0:28:15.00,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ The Queen of Hearts, she made some tarts, ♪\N♪ All on a summer day; ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.60,0:28:30.00,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ The Knave of Hearts, he stole those tarts, ♪\N♪ And took them clean away! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.00,0:28:45.00,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ Will you walk a little faster? ♪\N♪ Said a whiting to a snail. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.60,0:28:58.00,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ There's a porpoise close behind us, ♪\N♪ And he's treading on my tail. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.60,0:29:12.00,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ See how eagerly the lobsters ♪\N♪ And the turtles all advance! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.60,0:29:26.00,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ They are waiting on the shingle— ♪\N♪ Will you come and join the dance? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.60,0:29:40.00,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ Will you, won't you, will you, ♪\N♪ Won't you, will you join the dance? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.60,0:29:58.50,Song,,0,0,0,,♪ Will you, won't you, will you, ♪\N♪ Won't you, won't you join the dance? ♪